      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.25,
      "end_seconds": 3.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "Welcome. Make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.53,
      "end_seconds": 8.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Hello, um, thanks for fitting me in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.4,
      "end_seconds": 11.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "What's been worrying you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.09,
      "end_seconds": 19.85,
      "duration_seconds": 7.76,
      "text": "honestly, it's hearing getting worse in both ears, and my family pushed me to come"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.38,
      "end_seconds": 24.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "so, I'll do your observations first"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.19,
      "end_seconds": 37.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "sit still for a moment.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.76,
      "end_seconds": 63.0,
      "duration_seconds": 15.24,
      "text": "Okay: SpO2 98 percent on room air, pressure 124 over 76, temperature is 36.8 degrees, pulse is 78 beats a minute. Right, has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.75,
      "end_seconds": 71.38,
      "duration_seconds": 7.63,
      "text": "Ever since... since last weekend, really. My neighbour said I should get it looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.0,
      "end_seconds": 75.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.58,
      "end_seconds": 92.77,
      "duration_seconds": 16.19,
      "text": "It usually comes with ringing in the ears. The ringing in the ears? That's been for about four days. About ringing in the ears, it just comes and goes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.86,
      "end_seconds": 99.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "So, did you get facial weakness, vertigo or discharge?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.67,
      "end_seconds": 108.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.76,
      "text": "no facial weakness, vertigo or discharge, none of it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.76,
      "end_seconds": 113.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "I follow. What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.99,
      "end_seconds": 116.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "No, that side's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.07,
      "end_seconds": 120.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.17,
      "end_seconds": 136.23,
      "duration_seconds": 15.06,
      "text": "No, I've never smoked in my life. Nothing, I'm teetotal. No, I share a house with my brother. I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.3,
      "end_seconds": 140.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.35,
      "end_seconds": 144.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Not to my knowledge, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.62,
      "end_seconds": 155.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Any regular medication at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.75,
      "end_seconds": 159.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "No, I don't take any tablets."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.5,
      "end_seconds": 169.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "So, any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.25,
      "end_seconds": 172.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "No, not at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.59,
      "end_seconds": 188.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.76,
      "end_seconds": 193.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "No, I've always been fairly healthy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.57,
      "end_seconds": 201.1,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.87,
      "end_seconds": 217.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "okay, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.04,
      "end_seconds": 220.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.29,
      "end_seconds": 237.81,
      "duration_seconds": 6.52,
      "text": "Both ear drums look normal and the tuning fork is heard better through the bone"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 238.49,
      "end_seconds": 240.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.31,
      "end_seconds": 255.98,
      "duration_seconds": 10.67,
      "text": "That's the examination finished. From what you've told me and what I found, it points towards a conductive hearing loss, possibly otosclerosis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 256.94,
      "end_seconds": 258.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "Is this permanent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.17,
      "end_seconds": 288.71,
      "duration_seconds": 28.54,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a conductive hearing loss, possibly otosclerosis, but I'd like to confirm. Let's get a CT scan of the ears, for possible otosclerosis. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. I'll request a hearing test, it'll help with hearing loss. A hearing aid or an operation are both options after the tests."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.63,
      "end_seconds": 297.17,
      "duration_seconds": 7.54,
      "text": "if the symptoms get worse, that's the point to come in urgently i'd like you back after the tests"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.68,
      "end_seconds": 300.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Good, I'll return then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.83,
      "end_seconds": 304.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "that's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 306.34,
      "end_seconds": 309.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "I think I understand everything thanks"
    }
  ]
